            "review_title": "Review at Ancient Town",
            "review_text": "George\nAdelaide, Australia544 contributions\n1\nAncillary town\nNov 2019 • Solo\nMy third visit to Ancient town a must see when you visit Hoi An,the many cafes restaurants and shopping and historical buildings all in the one area,many of the bag shoe and clothing stores are hand made locally of high quality some stores prohibit photos taken inside their premises.roads within ancient town are closed for vehicle’s in the evenings and you walk around without worrying about traffic.ticket purchase to enter some of the historical buildings Within ancient town are found at ticket info stalls at the entrances.\nRead more\nWritten November 15, 2019",
