            "review_text": "azurest94\nBerlin, Germany76 contributions\n0\nAwesome place for chatting and drinking\nMay 2016 • Friends\nMy friends and I came to Hanoi in the afternoon so we decided to stroll around its Ancient street. We tasted some Hanoi street foods that our guide introduced, they are fine, quite delicious. Then, we drunk some cool beers in Ta Hien street and made friends with other tourists who were drinking too. Our conversation was so funny . This is an amazing experience that i will never forget about my Hanoi trip.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten August 18, 2016",
