            "review_text": "Sharls G\nTraralgon, Australia334 contributions\n0\nThe place to be!\nSep 2013 • Friends\nIf you have to stay anywhere in Hanoi, it should be the old quarter. Its where all the action happens and all the great shopping is. \nStreet hawkers are going to hassle you to death, but its all done with good humour and a smile.\nBe sure to stop at New Day for a feed for lunch or dinner and if you want to 'commission' any art work, call in to Ha Gallery.\nYou wont be disappointed :-)\nRead more\nWritten October 5, 2013",
