            "review_text": "fwc\nParaparaumu, New Zealand100 contributions\n0\nGotta go by golf buggy\nOct 2012 • Friends\nWe walked for miles looking at the ancient town and got very hot and very sticky. It seemed to be miles of shops full of cheap tat that was not appealing to European tastes, and even the hawkers knew that we were not potential buyers. But, we decided to jump on a green tourist golf cart one hour tour. This was very good - we saw lots, stopped at the right sights, the printed commentary told us what we were looking at and we felt safe from the ever present swarm of motor cycles.\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten October 20, 2012",
